        modernizedMeaning: 'Using military force as collective punishment against non-combatant populations for political defiance.',
        historicalSignificance: 'Operation Castigo (Operation Punishment) resulted in the execution of General Alexander Löhr at the postwar Belgrade war crimes trials.'
